Before the slice, `. scripts/env.sh` does not exist and `go test ./...` fails (no `go.mod`).

`cmd/pit/main_test.go`, table-driven over `run(args, &stdout, &stderr)`:
- no arguments: exit 2, usage on stderr naming `asm`, `run`, `tourney`, `view`;
- `help`: exit 0, usage on stdout;
- `bogus`: exit 2, stderr names the unknown subcommand.
